1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,897
Every AI product starts
with a breakthrough.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,775
Then usage grows.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,947
So do the tokens, the models,
the retries, and the costs.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,660
The obvious fix?

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,465
Switch to something cheaper.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,994
But cheaper can fail quietly.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,450
A lower bill means nothing
if the result breaks.

8
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,222
That's why we built ZEVQORA.

9
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:30,171
We map how AI work actually runs.

10
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:35,581
We identify expensive paths, test
alternatives, and measure what changes.

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,389
We replay representative workloads
against defined requirements.

12
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,155
If the evidence passes,
the change can be reviewed.

13
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,756
If quality drops, it's rejected.

14
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,944
If the proof isn't there,
we say: incomplete.

15
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,960
No blind switches.

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,960
No manufactured savings.

17
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,260
Measure.

18
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,160
Replay.

19
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,110
Verify.

20
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:58,548
Then optimize.

21
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,405
ZEVQORA.

22
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,182
Make AI lighter.
